__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
installer/.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.DS_Store
**/.installed.json

# Under .claude/ we track what the TEAM owns and ignore what a DEVELOPER owns —
# see docs/adr/0001. Tracked: .claude/scars.md, .claude/onboard/topics.yaml,
# .claude/adr/config.yaml (one truth per repo, reviewed in PRs; our own skills
# tell users to commit them, so a blanket ignore would contradict us).
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json
# Ignored: one developer's goals, self-rated level and dated record of what they
# got wrong. It collides between developers and is nobody else's business.
.claude/learning/
